{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35393","headline":"经九华山费徵君故居 · 张乔","name":"经九华山费徵君故居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草堂芜没後，来往问樵翁。\n断石荒林外，孤坟晚照中。\n数溪分大野，九子立寒空。\n烟壁曾行处，青云路不通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}